ах норм убыли</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr9866/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9866" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9866"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas1dg7c3/"></a><strong>возложено на виновных лиц</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr9867/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9867" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9867"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas1d8vrk/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr9868/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9868" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9868"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasf57pif/"></a><strong>Списано на расходы производства и периода сверх норм убыли</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr9869/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9869" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9869"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasmg3faa/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr9870/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9870" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9870"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas180z2a/"></a><strong>сумма</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr9871/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9871" data-dwh-source-type-favorit