rase-anchor="bssPhr10001"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfascvef6v/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:7.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10002/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10002" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10002"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasp8mmxc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:12.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10003/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10003" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10003"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas4irpsv/"></a>&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10004/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10004" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10004"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas4mx9sk/"></a><strong>Р А С П И С К А</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10005/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10005" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10005"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasf4yip4/"></a>К началу проведения инвентаризации все расходные и приходные документы на основные средства переданы в службу бухгалтерии и все основные средства, поступившие под мою (нашу) ответственность, оприходованы, а выбывшие списаны в расход.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10006/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10006" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10006"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas1gzrq8/"></a>Лицо(а), ответственное(ые) за сохранность основных средств:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10007/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10007" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10007"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfaseqar4g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:30%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10008/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10008" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10008"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfaszb9dv9/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10009/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10009" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10009"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfastkvx0t/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10010/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10010" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10010"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfase2pgnl/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10011/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10011" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10011"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasnbrnmq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:30%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10012/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10012" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10012"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfaszwvq5t/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr10013/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10013" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10013"></