-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11775/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11775" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11775"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfase6nnwd/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:5.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11776/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11776" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11776"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasyg3xxz/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:9.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11777/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11777" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11777"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasmzosvu/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:15.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11778/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11778" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11778"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfastgrl1a/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:40.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11779/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11779" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11779"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas2o04mm/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:6.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11780/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11780" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11780"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfask9gnau/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:8.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11781/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11781" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11781"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasaxgy8g/"></a>&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11782/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11782" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11782"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas9pu9n1/"></a><strong>РАСПИСКА</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11783/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11783" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11783"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasf1dzek/"></a>К началу проведения инвентаризации все расходные и приходные документы на денежные средства переданы в службу бухгалтерии и все поступившие под мою ответственность денежные средства оприходованы, а выбывшие списаны в расход.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11784/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11784" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11784"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas19rh3d/"></a>Материально ответственное лицо</p></td><td style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11785/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11785" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11785"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasqwu0aw/"></a>__________________</p></td><td style="width:19%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11786/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11786" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11786"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas98elxb/"></a>______________</p></td><td style="width:27%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11787/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11787" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11787"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfassc267q/"></a>_______________</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11788/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11788" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11788"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasgm6tpf/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11789/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11789" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11789"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas1r03fw/"></a>должность</p></td><td style="width:19%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11790/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11790" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11790"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasrwhoc1/"></a>подпись</p></td><td style="width:27%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11791/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11791" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11791"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfaswn0mq7/"></a>Ф.И.О.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11792/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11792" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11792"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasc6gueg/"></a>На основании приказа (распоряжения) от &#34;____&#34; ____________ 20__ года N ____ произведена инвентаризация денежных средств по состоянию на &#34;____&#34; ____________ 20__ года.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11793/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11793" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11793"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasaahsg7/"></a>В процессе инвентаризации установлено следующее:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11794/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11794" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11794"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasph9in1/"></a>1)</p></td><td style="width:72%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11795/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11795" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11795"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas9huhcs/"></a>наличные деньги _____________ сум. ______ тийин</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11796/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11796" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11796"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfashk73i3/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11797/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11797" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11797"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas1n06eb/"></a>2)</p></td><td style="width:72%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11798/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11798" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11798"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasxoqlf0/"></a>почтовые марки _____________ сум. ______ тийин</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11799/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11799" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11799"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas9xs9uq/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11800/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11800" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11800"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasf5ow41/"></a>3)</p></td><td style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11801/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11801" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11801"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasso0g0q/"></a>____________________________ сум. ______ тийин</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11802/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11802" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11802"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasgt88af/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11803/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11803" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11803"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasgor4gx/"></a>4)</p></td><td style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr11804/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11804" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11804"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasrsxh9c/"></a>____________________________ сум. ______ тийин</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-wor