ы, указанные в настоящей описи проверил:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12217/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12217" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12217"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas7pq9o9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12218/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12218" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12218"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfaskxwh0v/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12219/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12219" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12219"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasub58h6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12220/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12220" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12220"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas23porp/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12221/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12221" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12221"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasdtggt6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:31%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12222/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12222" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12222"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasb53mwd/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-