ь)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12482/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12482" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12482"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfaspth46u/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12483/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12483" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12483"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasfv40z2/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12484/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12484" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas7f3ev9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfasvflkz9/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas8wsntw/"></a>&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="12487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr12487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/dfas3ghd65/"></a>Приложение к форме ИНВ-17</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14820/bssPhr12488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phr